title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Result › Next actions
route: /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042
intro: The buttons on the verdict banner and where each one leads. Which buttons show depends on the verdict, on whether the patient has a case, and on why coverage failed.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: 'Request retro-eligibility' and 'Ask Caller to phone the payer' raise a message and change nothing. No call is made and no request is sent.
---
start s1 "On a result page, read the buttons on the verdict banner"

decision q1 "Verdict is 'Authorization first'?"
click c1 "Click 'Start authorization'"
process p1 "Opens New case with payer, level of care, member ID, initials and age filled in\nRequest type is 'Admission'"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Medical records › The checklist and Continue"

decision q2 "Is there a request with this ID?"
click c2 "Click 'Open case'\n(dark button, or outlined beside 'Start authorization')"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in"
decision q3 "ID starts with 'V-' (a new check, no case yet)?"
click c3 "Click 'Open in Case Manager'"
goto g3 "Continues in: Case Manager"
process n1 "No 'Start authorization' button"
process p2 "No case button is shown\nThe check has no case yet"

decision q4 "What is the coverage state?"
click c4 "Click 'Request retro-eligibility'"
toast t1 "'Retro-eligibility requested'\n'Navigator will ask Ohio Medicaid to restore coverage from 10/12. You will be told when it answers.'"
ext x1 "Ohio Medicaid restores the dates\n(demo: simulated, nothing is sent)"
click c5 "Click 'Ask Caller to phone the payer'"
toast t2 "'Caller will phone the payer'\n'Caller will ask Evergreen about this member and log the call to the case.'"
ext x2 "The payer's provider line\n(demo: simulated, nothing is dialled)"
endx e1 "Coverage is active: no extra button\nOther failures are fixed in the case or by 'Check again'"

click c6 "Click 'Check again'"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Re-verify a patient"
click c7 "Click '← Eligibility & Benefits'"
goto g5 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › List › What the screen shows"
click c8 "Click '← Back to referral RF-2040'\nWith ?case= in the address it reads '← Back to case R-1042'\nShown only when the check began from a referral"
goto g6 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Referral › The full referral page"

s1 --> q1 & q2 & q4 & c6 & c7 & c8
c8 --> g6
q1 -->|Yes| c1 --> p1 --> g1
q1 -->|No| n1
q2 -->|Yes| c2 --> g2
q2 -->|No| q3
q3 -->|Yes| p2
q3 -->|No| c3 --> g3
q4 -->|Lapsed| c4 --> t1 --> x1
q4 -->|Ended or not found| c5 --> t2 --> x2
q4 -->|Active| e1
c6 --> g4
c7 --> g5
